EctoPad first-door animation diagnostics, 2026-08-13

This patch adds low-frequency runtime breadcrumbs only; it does not alter door
state, collision, rendering, or animation selection. The physical trace proves
the first tutorial door receives Open, has an authored 0.833333-second clip,
selects animation type 0, and reports IsAnimating=true. The model nevertheless
remains visibly closed while the player can walk through it. This narrows the
remaining defect to animated model pose/presentation rather than door scripts,
collision, missing animation data, or an absent Open request.

The diagnostics remain in the final build so the next physical run can be
correlated without replaying this investigation.
